<p>Prints an integer to the log file.
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Void%20keyword" title="Void keyword">void</a> PrintInteger(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> nInteger,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> bPrepend&#160;= FALSE<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nInteger<dd>The integer value to print out to the log<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">bPrepend<dd>Specifies if the type of value should be prepended on to the log string
</dl>
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
<p><dd>Nothing.
</p>
</dl><dl><dt>Source:
<p><dd><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Script.ldf" title="Script.ldf">script.ldf</a>
</p>
